    {
      "uid": "zhcn:897be2a76d2897515bfc1bd1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在天皇赏（秋）即将举行的某一天。\n无声铃鹿问待兼福来：\n“你现在幸福吗？”",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fbd9fb6573724e9df2d1e7c9c82c30f1d5d97cceb8daa4a66f8712cb6807349",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
