      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b55a38ad0f0139ad42d8de6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来与无声铃鹿\n各自追求着不一样的幸福，\n为此不断前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "562bf704a253ba9d44687c306147690da95c0b573573d3b3902fdbc9dc83b488",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ea61a03257e0a2f94d1df15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每个人的天命",
      "source_fingerprint": "a837dd26711e20f831d092d722f5ff3681a1107f8680ab3a296fa9522e10b80d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf45a072e80c1c7fd1337e4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“有马纪念”即将开始的某一天。\n待兼福来打算在神社向神明许愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "102fa1c57cb74aa95f6fbd866a6effc0379602a288bb56f1bedcd17bd47553b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:410bcb1fb9bd743dee6910ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她认为胜利应该由自己亲手抓住，\n所以想改成其他愿望……结果发现\n自己竟然没有任何事情可以拜托神明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c70a481394016a507e681430f61eede8b05f0dc2c8eb815be3a800382634f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03874c442261c6d0173f404e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是待兼福来转而向神明表达决心，\n说自己会在“有马纪念”\n拿下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66a5b9ab490faaedcaa8cf9b732f5e00da7dd0b4768c24df22504fc7515a1918",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5e2d5730192f73c1fcad564",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "将誓言送达！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a888e8dd208f81bfd3e343cbec4703dd241472fc961beba2c9b87aac5a46bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b9cfe8e2a444673c6904433",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迈向“菊花赏”的决胜之夏到来了。\n巴士朝着集训宿舍动了起来，\n往代表幸运的方位前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b3ba8bfc4e1b26731c65a1e6886b752776b23c51100b7108f1a6d4bdeb22270",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b1f7ee65f0e9025769dbc55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来很高兴地表示自己运气很好。\n但是巴士却通过幸运方位，驶向了大凶方位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc611ec5ab55f5cdd9d95ab6ac553a783375e7dc8a50f34c6ab439c057c71849",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb56de18f965958358203c77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来认为这趟集训可能会碰上\n许多苦难，感到十分绝望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04975925bf7e1c03a039d9b44125a2c0f71e39e573cc9058d0e7d21d745c60ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:123c736b068d26a2b53790b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d25ebd5bdfebf906693ed7d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将展开地方远征的第三年夏季集训开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "257eb5f1972650e6b4945621c469f2faf28b4308d7d638396401146653228d35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc6860b1b2a9e2258659bfc8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来展现十足干劲，\n打算在夏天的严苛训练中\n完成各种事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3c6ae25b807b361b42623832aa1b1e66b7f240e00c3629dd423fbf474651458",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170095118644801dd00cf25a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过重重努力，\n精神饱满地决定亲手掌握幸运的她，\n顶着盛夏的天空飞奔而出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2a36c3ae4f6f63e17b39101fe48d80d9ef1db9ef4c48c4de031efbab07c0e8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ee8682c783467d910c14436",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d800a2c1c07c0d23e9a8de65",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "参加出道战的日子到了。\n待兼福来语带埋怨地说\n自己快承受不了压力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f8ac3b22f8fc9d1e212d690160cdffa8011f15cdb26d79f4430095de959b6ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b69b0d4e8b07ce97db5d1f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，她还有神明这个\n十分强大的伙伴陪在身边！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f7e4d8524e44e43df88c530afa82ccaa3b869b443b7425ffa26cfaf98890c78",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a68b56bce4ff5f8ef32c1c85",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回想起这件事的待兼福来\n认真地向神明祈祷，\n然后就前往参加出道战了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41e845988123b18841faba76fd38c21bf177b35296600f3a7791a904e336a2ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b639db5ffba5a53b993611d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
