    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f84615cdd367b4473a5300ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "日本德比的举办日终于到来了。\n待兼福来内心充斥着熊熊燃烧的干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94adb16dadc084cc0fd29d7a20bd660bbadf01eb8caef30f784a78329ac1791e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d2336a116b823eceddb302f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼福来表示自己总是做好万全的\n避邪除厄措施，所以充满自信地说\n自己不会被德比的魔物给吞噬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6a1a4a0ada33de461a51b35c328d0d7869dd7aec41c3e35d23e57e16b38eec1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f5a66213ed04ce595bb66d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是她就这样前往参加比赛，\n打算使出自己的所有实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b54ccf5c81057f09a85870812481ea886033dfadbaded0365a54abe423ad8f21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056412.json",
      "json_path": [
