    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db107444ba86c5bbfd25508e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过一直相信着待兼福来的\n粉丝们投票表决，\n她确定将参加“宝冢纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0868b3001d0792ee55d7ee6bd3a6a0b380597b3431a2a31bb763bb20a76c8a64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f340d7c8cae041fa21f992",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了尽可能报答\n一直支持着她的粉丝们──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e70f5d8164c31ea05a515c98bc1314a1b706ba10bdebd597efd8c29bfea29b63",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38981c3aae924ffbf1695533",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她坚定地表示自己不会全靠运气，\n将展现她自己的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "211d752dd412795f19f679aa5102f0af434e53f9bf80a0657b35e46a4f0f5070",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1056/storytimeline_501056415.json",
